cVOQktR5VsaAYlby5hT-2oVNarAvLX9bni5nG-LIO1v0bZ1LmXKA1lcaOSrTzkg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsQg822-Cs5DwmMWT2QIQvdHN85g4q_OgBV8VBxsadRQw&oe=699998BB"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates03cropped.png", "id": "337914812432265", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974774_337914815765598_1762840369253842605_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fm5J0S4s1VAQ7kNvwE2dOxQ&_nc_oc=AdkRiWTuQ0p_qtRHwCaoC2tTTPngDUE-UU61mkNKvz5s4U05PyZx07vXGOwc-EKDu70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfslE4WRrFr9-CG9BOBWl2MsLFJvPbFQk_nwIZ2fHhRCbw&oe=69999321"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates04cropped.png", "id": "367552249204365", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_367552252537698_6058304213158592905_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qhs-iYhE2CAQ7kNvwHIJogA&_nc_oc=Admv0VhW7T6yMlkTvNNvo4YxZar7Du2e2L_rEZs9Qx0l2LHeWxjswfDY6FwMnVBxbqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfspIXIK_0N-0HBp9mJttJdAqMS1NV29voZ95XVGFN5DCA&oe=6999C1A5"}, {"file_name": "Chess cropped.png", "id": "902765531159168", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984463_902765534492501_3956653358745274292_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=otgyaCqW2SYQ7kNvwGC8uZj&_nc_oc=Adk_9xsoVWNhsRTI_B96K0SUkXhG9WBUbF3VHyD5fJnFKVT6Q6XCZ_sNpeNoEnUEb8Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuQ1x_1MV6LVFZNTIoZEt6pGyg0kuoWopdFWlP7jd6mxQ&oe=6999BCA3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerScreenshot cropped.png", "id": "717849803637730", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982545_717849806971063_8753740338935084738_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bnfRtCDjPjAQ7kNvwExAF9n&_nc_oc=Adm2jy1ptdIJp0db9zYaV0h82AHe_wk1xNy6HhkPLbi3Pgvfr7jk0oRYyJfopnSfgTo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu9WL7EGh4U2--QOLGXhqewqFsziIhP7U0Xq4_yxKBouA&oe=69999E3B"}, "display_name": "VRShogiMates", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to VRShogiMates, your gateway to a captivating virtual realm of classic board games! As a solo developer's passion project, this app delivers an unparalleled experience featuring Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and the unique Gungi from Hunter X Hunter.\n\nMultiplayer Mode:\nChallenge opponents worldwide in real-time or correspondence matches. Whether facing friends or discovering new adversaries, the global multiplayer functionality ensures a dynamic and engaging experience.\n\nHow to play:\nNew to these intricate games? No problem! VRShogiMates provides comprehensive rules, instructions, and a game record for each game type to help you learn. Explore the rules, grasp essential strategies, and elevate your skills!\n\nRegular Updates and Support:\nMy commitment doesn't end at launch. Expect continuous updates, bug fixes, performance enhancements, and exciting new features driven by valuable feedback from us.\n\nUnique Highlights:\nVenture into the unexplored VR realms of Shogi, Chu Shogi, Xiangqi, and Gungi - experiences currently not offered by any other VR app on the market! The last game type, Gungi, brings a touch of fantasy to your gaming repertoire. It\u2019s refreshingly different from other board games, check it out!\n\nEmbark on this virtual journey, where tradition meets innovation, and every move is a step towards victory. VRShogiMates is not just a game; it's a portal to a world where strategy, competition, and community converge. Join us and redefine your board gaming experience!", "short_description": "Dive into the immersive world of board games with VRShogiMates! Play Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and Gungi in a stunning virtual environment. Challenge friends globally in real-time or turn-based multiplayer. Learn the rules for all the games, while enjoying regular updates for an ever-evolving gaming experience.\n\nInternet connection is required to play. (For now)\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develop